{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/a609cf8a05839fa2feeca565eac7de11.poster.avif?t=1761841042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/a609cf8a05839fa2feeca565eac7de11.webm?t=1761841042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/a609cf8a05839fa2feeca565eac7de11.mp4?t=1761841042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f <strong>Welcome to the Dump</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore endless piles of junk, dig up lost cards, and expand your collection. Everything that was once lost \u2014 can now be found again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf\u00a0Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sort, collect.<br>Every pile of trash is a chance to find a rare card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the birds</strong><br>Pull them out of garbage piles and make them cozy nests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible cards</strong><br>Restore your full collection of favorite cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor, references, and trash aesthetics</strong><br>A world where garbage is art, and every discovery can become a trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No battles. Just trash.</strong><br>You just dig. In garbage. For love. And for cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/6651f58b083de3d55b5da074bc5c0932.poster.avif?t=1761841042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/6651f58b083de3d55b5da074bc5c0932.webm?t=1761841042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/6651f58b083de3d55b5da074bc5c0932.mp4?t=1761841042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0Who\u2019s it for?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love simulators, collecting, irony, and relaxing gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe for those who still remember their lost card collection.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868310?t=1761841042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868310?t=1761841042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/6df46e4b11bc69121d07aec6dcff8fe7f70663cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761841042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/6df46e4b11bc69121d07aec6dcff8fe7f70663cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761841042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4027860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/a609cf8a05839fa2feeca565eac7de11.poster.avif?t=1761841042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/a609cf8a05839fa2feeca565eac7de11.webm?t=1761841042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/e